# 🌸 Data Classification Using AI

A professional Machine Learning project developed as part of the **DecodeLabs Artificial Intelligence Internship**.

This project demonstrates the complete workflow of building a supervised machine learning model using the famous Iris Dataset and the K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN) classification algorithm.

---

## 📌 Project Objectives

- Load and understand a real-world dataset
- Explore the dataset
- Perform data preprocessing
- Split the dataset into training and testing sets
- Apply feature scaling
- Train a K-Nearest Neighbors classifier
- Evaluate model performance using different metrics

---

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- Python 3
- Scikit-Learn
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib

