## ⚙ Installation

Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/Project-2-Data-Classification.git
```

Move into the project

```bash
cd Project-2-Data-Classification
```

Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run the project

```bash
python Project_2_KNN_Classification.py
```

